---
import BaseLayout from '../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import Careers from '../../components/islands/Careers';
import '../../styles/commerce.css';
---
<BaseLayout title="Careers & Internships | CUMID" description="Help shape CUMID. Apply in design, content, web development, marketing or operations with a short introduction and your work.">
 <section class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-5 py-12"><header class="mb-10"><p class="text-sm text-lavender-700">Build something with us.</p><h1 class="text-4xl mt-3 mb-4">Good ideas need good people.</h1><p class="max-w-2xl leading-relaxed">We are a small diary brand with a love for art and personality. Tell us what you do and what you would like to help make.</p><p class="text-sm mt-4">Role scope, compensation, location and duration will be agreed before any engagement. Applying does not guarantee a position. There is no application fee.</p><p class="mt-4"><a href="/careers/tasks" class="underline">Already applied? Go to the task portal →</a></p></header><Careers client:load /></section>
</BaseLayout>
